<b style="font-size:15px">Status no ERP</b><span class="lu-small lu-muted" style="margin-bottom:6px">O mesmo formato para lote de notas, importação e backup.</span>
<div style="padding:22px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--bg-tray);border:1px solid var(--line)">
<div class="lu-col" style="gap:10px;align-items:flex-start">
  <.status_toast state="run">Emitindo <b>32 NF-e</b> do lote <b>#118</b><:action>Cancelar</:action></.status_toast>
  <.status_toast state="run" percent={42}>Importando <b>extrato BB</b>, <b>412 de 980</b> linhas<:action>Ocultar</:action></.status_toast>
  <.status_toast state="ok"><b>Backup</b> concluído, <b>1,2 GB</b><:action>Baixar</:action></.status_toast>
</div>
</div>
